<p>
  This site keeps cookies and browser storage to a minimum.
</p>

<p>
  We store your day or night edition preference in local storage. For article audio, local storage remembers listening position and playback speed for each recording on this device. Session storage remembers when you hide the compact player. These playback settings are not sent to us, and clearing this site's browser storage removes them.
</p>

<p>
  We serve our fonts locally, so loading the site does not require a request to Google Fonts or another third-party font host.
</p>

<p>
  Our hosting and security providers may also use strictly necessary cookies or similar technologies to keep the site available and protect it from abuse.
</p>

<p>
  We do not use advertising cookies on this site.
</p>

<p>
  When Google Analytics is configured for production, it may set first-party analytics cookies to distinguish visits, estimate engagement, and produce aggregate reports about page views, referrals, clicks, and other site interactions. These cookies help us prove audience activity for monetization conversations, but they are not used by this site to create advertising profiles.
</p>

<p>
  If you subscribe, Buttondown handles the signup and delivery flow. Any Buttondown cookies or browser storage happen on Buttondown's own pages, not on this site.
</p>

<p>
  If we add any other non-essential cookie-based tool, we will disclose it here before it goes live and add consent controls where the law requires them.
</p>

<p>
  Questions about cookies or browser storage can be sent to <a href="mailto:{{ site.contactEmail }}">{{ site.contactEmail }}</a>.
</p>
